nesdr — license
===============

The plugin's own source (nesdr_plugin.cpp, nesdr_models.{h,cpp}) is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full license text is in the
repository root `LICENSE`.

This plugin also compiles `plugins/rtl_sdr/rtl_sdr_device.{h,cpp}` from this
repository, which is under the same terms.

Linked third-party library
--------------------------

This plugin uses the RTL-SDR API and loads `librtlsdr` at runtime:

    librtlsdr — https://github.com/librtlsdr/librtlsdr
    GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Only the `rtl-sdr.h` header is used at compile time; the library
(`rtlsdr.dll` / `librtlsdr.so`) is loaded dynamically via `LoadLibrary`/`dlopen`,
so it remains user-replaceable. Redistributing this plugin alongside that library
carries the LGPL attribution and source-availability obligations for librtlsdr.
See the repository-root `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.

Trademark note
--------------

"NooElec" and "NESDR" are trademarks of Nooelec Inc. This plugin is an
independent, unaffiliated implementation that drives NESDR hardware through the
same public RTL-SDR API any other application uses; it contains no NooElec code
and is not endorsed by Nooelec Inc. The model names are used solely to identify
which hardware a capability profile describes.
